    [20632]={name="Mindtear Band",quality=4,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Taerar.",npc="Taerar",lore="A Nightmare-corrupted green dragon who splits himself into shades rather than face a fight whole.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [20641]={name="Southsea Mojo Boots",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Southsea Shakedown'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Security Chief Bilgewhizzle in Tanaris. Objective: Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to kill 10 Southsea Pirates, 10 Southsea Freebooters, 10 Southsea Dock Workers and 10 Southsea Swashbucklers.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Southsea Shakedown",lore="They want the impossible from me! The Steamwheedle Cartel wants me to teach the Southsea pirates a lesson."},
    [20642]={name="Antiquated Nobleman's Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=47,reqLevel=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Oran's Gratitude'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Oran Snakewrithe in Undercity. Objective: Now isn't this interesting? You say you found this tablet on a small, deserted island at The Overlook Cliffs in The Hinterlands, &lt;class&gt;? Very interesting indeed. I thank you for your efforts in this matter. Our Dark Lady shall be very pleased with this discovery. Here, allow me to reward you proportionately.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Oran's Gratitude"},
    [20643]={name="Undercity Reservist's Cap",quality=2,ilvl=47,reqLevel=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Oran's Gratitude'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Oran Snakewrithe in Undercity. Objective: Now isn't this interesting? You say you found this tablet on a small, deserted island at The Overlook Cliffs in The Hinterlands, &lt;class&gt;? Very interesting indeed. I thank you for your efforts in this matter. Our Dark Lady shall be very pleased with this discovery. Here, allow me to reward you proportionately.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Oran's Gratitude"},
    [20647]={name="Black Crystal Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Silithus. Objective: Bring Deathclasp's Pincer to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard.",zone="Silithus",questName="Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands",lore="The terrible scorpid, Deathclasp, is believed to have retreated to the southern mountain range in the presence of increased silithid activity."},
    [20648]={name="Cold Forged Hammer",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hero of the Stormpike'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Prospector Stonehewer in Alterac Valley. Objective: As a hero of the Stormpike, you may choose one item from these recently plun... er, recovered treasures.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Hero of the Stormpike"},
    [20682]={name="Elemental Focus Band",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Prince Skaldrenox.",zone="Silithus",npc="Prince Skaldrenox"},
    [20685]={name="Wavefront Necklace",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lord Skwol.",zone="Silithus",npc="Lord Skwol"},
    [20692]={name="Multicolored Band",quality=2,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="container",instructions="Found inside another item."},
    [20695]={name="Abyssal War Beads",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="container",instructions="Found inside another item."},
    [20712]={name="Wastewalker's Gauntlets",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Armaments of War'. Starts with Geologist Larksbane in Silithus. Objective: War comes, &lt;name&gt;, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded.Should this... this prophecy ever come to pass...The future of us all could be at an end.These armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert.",zone="Silithus",questName="Armaments of War"},
    [20724]={name="Corrupted Blackwood Staff",quality=2,ilvl=62,reqLevel=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Into The Maw of Madness'. Starts with Commander Mar'alith in Silithus. Objective: Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to find his beloved Natalia. The information that you gathered points to Hive'Regal in the south as being the area in which you may find Mistress Natalia Mar'alith.Do not forget to visit the dwarves at Bronzebeard's camp before venturing into the hive. They might have some additional work and advice for you.And &lt;name&gt;, remember the Commander's words: \"Do what you must...\".",zone="Silithus",questName="Into The Maw of Madness",lore="I need you to venture into Hive'Regal and find what became of my dearest Natalia. This will be no easy task for you. Before you dive headlong into the maw of madness, make sure that you go back and speak with those dwarves."},
    [21115]={name="Defiler's Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Rutherford Twing. Requires The Defilers - Friendly.",zone="Hammerfall",npc="Rutherford Twing",reqRep={{"The Defilers","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 454 to 554 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21116]={name="Defiler's Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Rutherford Twing. Requires The Defilers - Friendly.",zone="Hammerfall",npc="Rutherford Twing",reqRep={{"The Defilers","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 353 to 431 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21117]={name="Talisman of Arathor",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Samuel Hawke. Requires The League of Arathor - Friendly.",zone="Refuge Pointe",npc="Samuel Hawke",reqRep={{"The League of Arathor","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 454 to 554 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21118]={name="Talisman of Arathor",quality=3,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Samuel Hawke. Requires The League of Arathor - Friendly.",zone="Refuge Pointe",npc="Samuel Hawke",reqRep={{"The League of Arathor","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 353 to 431 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21119]={name="Talisman of Arathor",quality=3,ilvl=33,reqLevel=28,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Samuel Hawke. Requires The League of Arathor - Friendly.",zone="Refuge Pointe",npc="Samuel Hawke",reqRep={{"The League of Arathor","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 278 to 338 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21120]={name="Defiler's Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=33,reqLevel=28,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Rutherford Twing. Requires The Defilers - Friendly.",zone="Hammerfall",npc="Rutherford Twing",reqRep={{"The Defilers","Friendly"}},proc="Use: Absorbs 278 to 338 physical damage.  Lasts 15 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21126]={name="Death's Sting",quality=4,ilvl=84,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."},
    [21134]={name="Dark Edge of Insanity",quality=4,ilvl=84,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped.",proc="Chance on hit: Disorients the target, causing it to wander aimlessly for up to 3 sec."},
    [21178]={name="Gloves of Earthen Power",quality=3,ilvl=62,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Volunteer's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 5 Cenarion Combat Badges, 3 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 7 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Friendly reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Volunteer's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21180]={name="Earthstrike",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Champion's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 20 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Cenarius to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Champion's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them.",proc="Use: Increases your melee and ranged attack power by 280.  Effect lasts for 20 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [21183]={name="Earthpower Vest",quality=3,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Veteran's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 7 Cenarion Combat Badges, 4 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 4 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Veteran's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21185]={name="Earthcalm Orb",quality=4,ilvl=62,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stalwart's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Stalwart's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Windcaller Proudhorn are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21186]={name="Rockfury Bracers",quality=4,ilvl=62,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stalwart's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Stalwart's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Windcaller Proudhorn are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [21187]={name="Earthweave Cloak",quality=3,ilvl=62,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Volunteer's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 5 Cenarion Combat Badges, 3 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 7 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Friendly reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Volunteer's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [21188]={name="Fist of Cenarius",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Champion's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 20 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Cenarius to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Champion's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 2.0%."},
    [21210]={name="Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Grand Invoker'. Starts with Anachronos in Tanaris. Objective: ProgressNever have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!Hand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Grand Invoker",reqRep={{"Brood of Nozdormu","Exalted"}}},
    [21242]={name="Blessed Qiraji War Axe",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Armaments'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Armaments",lore="We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21244]={name="Blessed Qiraji Pugio",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Armaments'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Armaments",lore="We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [21268]={name="Blessed Qiraji War Hammer",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Regalia'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Regalia",lore="I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power."},
    [21269]={name="Blessed Qiraji Bulwark",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Armaments'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Armaments",lore="We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world.",proc="Equip: Increases your chance to Block attacks with a shield by 3.0%."},
    [21273]={name="Blessed Qiraji Acolyte Staff",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Regalia'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Regalia",lore="I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 2.0%."},
    [21275]={name="Blessed Qiraji Augur Staff",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Regalia'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Regalia",lore="I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power."},
    [21311]={name="Earth Warder's Vest",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timbermaw Ally'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Felwood. Objective: Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 5 Deadwood Warriors, 5 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 5 Deadwood Gardeners.",zone="Felwood",questName="Timbermaw Ally",lore="The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe."},
    [21312]={name="Belt of the Den Watcher",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timbermaw Ally'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Felwood. Objective: Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 5 Deadwood Warriors, 5 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 5 Deadwood Gardeners.",zone="Felwood",questName="Timbermaw Ally",lore="The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe."},
    [21317]={name="Helm of the Pathfinder",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Deadwood of the North'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Felwood",questName="Deadwood of the North",lore="There is a camp of Deadwood furbolgs directly to our southwest. Corruption permeates the camp, and I wish to put an end to it before they become a problem.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21318]={name="Earth Warder's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21319]={name="Gloves of the Pathfinder",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21320]={name="Vest of the Den Watcher",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21372]={name="Stormcaller's Diadem",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stormcaller's Diadem'. Starts with Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring Vek'lor's Diadem, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Stormcaller's Diadem",lore="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21373]={name="Stormcaller's Footguards",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stormcaller's Footguards'. Starts with Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Stormcaller's Footguards",lore="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon."},
    [21374]={name="Stormcaller's Hauberk",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stormcaller's Hauberk'. Starts with Vethsera in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Stormcaller's Hauberk",lore="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21375]={name="Stormcaller's Leggings",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stormcaller's Leggings'. Starts with Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Skin of the Great Sandworm, 2 Idols of Strife, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Stormcaller's Leggings",lore="Bring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [21376]={name="Stormcaller's Pauldrons",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stormcaller's Pauldrons'. Starts with Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of Life, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Stormcaller's Pauldrons",lore="Bring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!"},
    [21398]={name="Hammer of the Gathering Storm",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hammer of the Gathering Storm'.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Hammer of the Gathering Storm",lore="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong."},
    [21399]={name="Ring of the Gathering Storm",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ring of the Gathering Storm'. Starts with Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. Objective: Bring 1 Qiraji Magisterial Ring, 2 Vermillion Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Ring of the Gathering Storm",lore="The gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior. Bring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you."},
    [21400]={name="Cloak of the Gathering Storm",quality=4,ilvl=67,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cloak of the Gathering Storm'. Starts with Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. Objective: Bring 1 Qiraji Regal Drape, 2 Obsidian Idols, 5 Clay Scarabs and 5 Gold Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Cloak of the Gathering Storm",lore="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy."},
    [21504]={name="Charm of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21505]={name="Choker of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21506]={name="Pendant of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21507]={name="Amulet of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21517]={name="Gnomish Turban of Psychic Might",quality=4,ilvl=75,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Only Prescription'. Starts with Narain Soothfancy in Molten Core. Objective: Recover the 8 lost chapters of Draconic for Dummies and combine them with the Magical Book Binding and return the completed book of Draconic for Dummies: Volume II to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Only Prescription",lore="I should have known. My arch-enemy, Doctor Weavil, up to his old tricks! And now, thanks to your failure in Winterspring, Doctor Weavil has destroyed my book!"},
    [21522]={name="Shadowsong's Sorrow",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Treasure of the Timeless One'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jonathan the Revelator in Silithus. Objective: Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun.",zone="Silithus",questName="Treasure of the Timeless One"},
    [21523]={name="Fang of Korialstrasz",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Treasure of the Timeless One'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jonathan the Revelator in Silithus. Objective: Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun.",zone="Silithus",questName="Treasure of the Timeless One"},
    [21526]={name="Band of Icy Depths",quality=4,ilvl=77,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Wrath of Neptulon'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Narain Soothfancy in Azshara. Objective: Use the Arcanite Buoy at the Swirling Maelstrom at the Bay of Storms in Azshara.",zone="Azshara",questName="The Wrath of Neptulon",lore="Did I mention the bad news yet? Its name is Maws: 100 feet of death and destruction. I guess I may have forgotten that little tidbit."},
    [21530]={name="Onyx Embedded Leggings",quality=4,ilvl=77,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Nefarius's Corruption'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vaelastrasz the Corrupt in Tanaris. Objective: Slay Nefarian and recover the Red Scepter Shard. Return the Red Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris. You have 5 hours to complete this task.",zone="Blackwing Lair",questName="Nefarius's Corruption",lore="Champion, is it you? A thousand years it has been since I was entrusted the shard and it is at my darkest hour that one should rise to relieve me of it..."},
    [21531]={name="Drake Tooth Necklace",quality=4,ilvl=77,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Nightmare Manifests'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Keeper Remulos in Moonglade. Objective: Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande.",zone="Moonglade",questName="The Nightmare Manifests",lore="We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him. Tyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction."},
    [21532]={name="Drudge Boots",quality=4,ilvl=77,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Nightmare Manifests'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Keeper Remulos in Moonglade. Objective: Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande.",zone="Moonglade",questName="The Nightmare Manifests",lore="We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him. Tyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction."},
